---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const focusAreas = [
  'Heal from the pain of your past',
  'Break free from repeated patterns of defeat',
  'Process grief, unmet emotional needs, and relational challenges',
  'Develop healthier relationships with others and with God',
  'Discover renewed purpose and potential'
];

const process = [
  ['01', 'Recognize the trigger'],
  ['02', 'Trace the root'],
  ['03', 'Remove the stones', 'Old pain, lies, defenses'],
  ['04', 'Do the work', 'Continually walk out your learned healing'],
  ['05', 'Grow new fruit', 'Peace, freedom, joy']
];
---
<BaseLayout title="What We Help With | Healing the Heart">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we are about</p>
      <h1>Healing the why behind the pattern.</h1>
      <p>Healing the Heart is a safe place to process unresolved pain, uncover root causes, and learn a new way to continually walk out healing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="rich-section about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our purpose</p>
        <h2>Safe space. Honest process. Lasting heart transformation.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>In our Healing the Heart classes, you'll find a safe and supportive environment to address deep struggles such as anger, addiction, relationship challenges, or feelings of rejection.</p>
        <p>Together, we'll uncover the root causes of your pain and guide you toward true emotional healing and freedom. Through the help of the Holy Spirit and practical Biblical principles, we'll walk with you step by step. You'll learn how to heal from past wounds, process your pain, and develop healthier relationships with others and with God.</p>
        <p>We're excited to see the transformation that God has in store for you and look forward to seeing you soon.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section soft-section">
    <div class="rich-section">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">What this can help with</p><h2>You may not need another way to hide the pain. You may need a safe place to face it.</h2></div>
      <div class="focus-grid">
        {focusAreas.map((area, index) => <div class="focus-card"><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><strong>{area}</strong></div>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="rich-section">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">How</p><h2>Walk the journey, not just hear about it.</h2></div>
        <div><p>Led by experienced facilitators, attendees are guided through their healing journey while learning a new way to continually walk out that healing.</p><p>The goal is not simply to change behavior. It is to understand the why behind it, address the root, remove what has been weighing on the heart, and grow new fruit.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="process-grid">
        {process.map((step) => <div class="process-card"><span>{step[0]}</span><strong>{step[1]}</strong>{step[2] && <small>{step[2]}</small>}</div>)}
      </div>

      <div class="simple-callout"><strong>Simple—but it’s a process.</strong><span>Deep—but so worth it.</span><p>It’s not about fixing your behavior; it’s about healing the why behind it.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dark-section section">
    <div class="rich-section">
      <p class="eyebrow light">Why attend</p>
      <h2>A place to process and recover.</h2>
      <p>Healing the Heart is ideal for individuals seeking deep emotional and spiritual healing. It is particularly beneficial for those who have experienced significant life challenges and need a place to process and recover in a supportive environment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="rich-section offerings-note">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we provide</p>
      <h2>A safe place for healing.</h2>
      <div class="program-notes">
        <article><p class="eyebrow">8-week online Zoom class</p><p>You'll engage in guided sessions by a Certified Facilitator who will provide practical tools for emotional healing, spiritual growth, and uncovering your locked-up purpose and potential—all from the comfort of your home.</p></article>
        <article><p class="eyebrow">Healing the Heart Retreat</p><p>Our Healing the Heart Retreat is a transformative journey designed to help you heal from past wounds and break free from patterns that hold you back. This retreat offers a safe and supportive environment to process grief, unmet emotional needs, and relational challenges. Begin your path to freedom and discover a renewed sense of purpose in a life-changing weekend experience.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="statement-band"><p>Healing the Heart — it’s not just healing. It’s heart transformation.</p></section>

  <style is="global">
    .about-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr); gap:3.5rem; align-items:start; }
    .about-grid h2 { margin:.2rem 0 0; }
    .about-grid p { line-height:1.75; }
    .soft-section { background:#f8f5f0; }
    .focus-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:.9rem; margin-top:2rem; }
    .focus-card { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem; padding:1.1rem 1.2rem; background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(40,30,20,.08); border-radius:16px; }
    .focus-card span { font-size:.72rem; font-weight:800; color:#8a7057; }
    .focus-card strong { line-height:1.4; }
    .process-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:.8rem; margin-top:2.5rem; }
    .process-card { min-height:150px; padding:1.15rem; border:1px solid rgba(40,30,20,.09); border-radius:18px; background:#fff; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.7rem; }
    .process-card span { font-size:.72rem; color:#8a7057; font-weight:800; }
    .process-card strong { line-height:1.3; }
    .process-card small { color:rgba(30,25,20,.58); line-height:1.45; }
    .simple-callout { margin-top:1.5rem; padding:1.5rem; border-left:3px solid #9b7650; background:#faf8f5; display:grid; gap:.3rem; }
    .simple-callout strong { font-size:1.15rem; }
    .simple-callout span { color:#705943; font-weight:700; }
    .simple-callout p { margin:.45rem 0 0; color:rgba(30,25,20,.68); }
    .offerings-note > h2 { margin:.2rem 0 1.5rem; }
    .program-notes { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:1rem; }
    .program-notes article { padding:1.35rem; border:1px solid rgba(40,30,20,.09); border-radius:18px; background:#fff; }
    .program-notes article p:last-child { margin-bottom:0; line-height:1.7; color:rgba(30,25,20,.7); }
    @media(max-width:800px){ .about-grid,.program-notes { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:1.5rem; } .process-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; } }
    @media(max-width:600px){ .focus-grid,.process-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
